# Template. Copy to .env for your own notes if you like -- nothing in this
# repository reads .env, and .env is gitignored.
#
# The system reads its credential from ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in the environment and
# stores it nowhere in the tree (NFR-10). Set it in the shell that runs the
# build:
#
#   PowerShell   $env:ANTHROPIC_API_KEY = "<your key>"
#   bash         export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<your key>
#
# With the variable unset the build still reconstructs the sequence, the
# relationships, the scope of compromise and the absent-source report, and
# reports affected behaviour as unmapped rather than omitting it (NFR-02).
#
# Only the model client under src/siem_investigator/agent/ reads the variable;
# no module under app/ touches the service directly.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
